# Widow in the west. Her husband died at the wall. Flags: rent_paid, rent_waived, rent_watch_sold
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('rent_paid') || HasFlag('rent_waived') || HasFlag('rent_watch_sold') || HasFlag('rent_ledger_torn') || HasFlag('Killed(pawn_rook)')
goto: Settled

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (She does not get up.) If Rook sent you, tell him tomorrow. He knows what tomorrow means.
+ Dario stood on the wall for them eleven years. One bad night and I owe a pawnbroker my own door.
#
o_text: How much?
o_id: marla_how_much
o_goto: HowMuch
#
o_text: Here. A hundred and fifty. Don't thank me.
o_id: marla_pay
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 150)
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: The watch on the table. Rook would pay the rent for it twice.
o_id: marla_watch
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: WatchSold
o_fail: WatchRefused
#
o_text: I'll talk to Rook.
o_id: marla_leave
o_goto: End

name: HowMuch
npc: A hundred and fifty by tomorrow. Or the flat, which he says is worth more empty.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: howmuch_back
o_goto: Default

name: Paid
npc: (She counts it, then stops counting.) I will not thank you, then. But I will remember.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 150)
effect: SetFlag('rent_paid')
#
o_text: Pay him today.
o_id: marla_paid_done
o_goto: End

name: WatchSold
npc: (A long silence. She takes it off the table.) He never wore it to the wall. Said he would not need to know the time there.
+ Tell Rook he gets it tonight. Tell him not to put it in the window.
effect: SetFlag('rent_watch_sold')
#
o_text: He will put it in the window.
o_id: marla_watch_done
o_goto: End

name: WatchRefused
npc: Get out.
#
o_text: (Leave.)
o_id: marla_watch_refused_leave
o_goto: End

name: Settled
npc: The rent is settled. The flat is still mine, and the chair is still empty.
#
o_text: Take care, Marla.
o_id: marla_settled_leave
o_goto: End

name: End
npc: (She turns back to the photo.)
effect: EndConversation
